1545 0 obj
<<
/Title (Algorithm NaivePathSearch\(graph, start, end\):     1. Identify all possible simple paths from 'start' to 'end'\)     2. Initialize 'min_cost' to infinity     3. Initialize 'optimal_path' as empty     4. For each path in all_paths:         a. Calculate total_cost of the current path \(sum of edge weights\)         b. If total_cost < min_cost:             i. Set min_cost = total_cost             ii. Set optimal_path = current path     5. Return optimal_path and min_cost)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1543 0 R
/Next 1547 0 R
>>
endobj
